{"id":"meinetwegen","lemma":"meinetwegen","pos":"adv","rank":1939,"glosses":["because of me; for my sake","as far as I'm concerned (I don't mind if); for all I care","say; for example"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɪ̯nətˌveːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b1/De-meinetwegen.ogg/De-meinetwegen.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du meinetwegen gekündigt?","en":"Did you quit because of me?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to cancel","l":"kündigen"}]},{"text":"Habt ihr meinetwegen gekündigt?","en":"Did you quit because of me?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"to cancel","l":"kündigen"}]},{"text":"Haben Sie meinetwegen gekündigt?","en":"Did you quit because of me?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"to cancel","l":"kündigen"}]},{"text":"Meinetwegen könnte ich es ausprobieren.","en":"I guess I could give it a try.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"to try out"}]},{"text":"Ich will nicht, dass du meinetwegen aufhörst.","en":"I don't want you to quit because of me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to stop","l":"aufhören"}]}]}